ckaging supplies, equipment, shipping supplies, janitorial/sanitation, stock and custom boxes -> /about-us", "Equipment repair services for packaging/industrial equipment and hand tools -> /about-us, /", "Digital platform: live ordering, real-time inventory, contract pricing, custom order pad, advanced reporting, invoice/order tracking -> /about-us", "Customer examples: Echo Park Paper Company, Recteq, Kimac Industries, Mountain View Pharmacy -> /about-us", "Cap lining for every industry -> /about-us, /", "Integrated partnership approach (operate as client''s employees) -> /about-us", "Focus on protection, cost efficiency, branding, sustainability -> /about-us", "Product categories: Corrugated, Tape, Cushioning & Void Fill, Stretch Wrap & Film, Poly Bags & Mailers, Labels, Cap Lining Closures and Containers -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "specializing in cap lining, packaging design, industrial packaging materials and laboratory and specimen packaging technologies; world-class innovation in design, manufacturing, product delivery", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='snowline-packaging-solutions' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Soeby Motor Company operates as a Ford dealership in Walhalla, North Dakota, serving the surrounding communities of Grafton, Devils Lake, and Grand Forks. The business retails new and pre‑owned Ford cars, crossovers, SUVs, and trucks, including the F‑150 and Super Duty lines.

The dealership’s service department employs factory‑trained technicians who perform repairs, scheduled maintenance, and parts installation using Motorcraft components. Those parts carry a two‑year, unlimited‑mileage warranty that includes labor coverage. The facility also arranges financing and lease agreements for vehicle purchases.

Customers include retail buyers as well as Ford employees and retirees who qualify for dedicated service discounts. The company participates in the Ford Rewards program, allowing members to earn 10 points per dollar spent on eligible service and redeem points for future visits.

