UPDATE companies SET description='Solar Renewable Energy, LLC (SRE) is based in Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania. The company was formed in January 2010 as a Pennsylvania limited liability corporation by Mr. Berry, drawing on his long-standing association with the public accounting firm ParenteBeard.

