UPDATE companies SET description='Somers Furniture LLC operates from a 4,500‑square‑foot warehouse, showroom and manufacturing facility in Las Vegas, Nevada. The business was founded in 1989 by Debbi Somers as Somers Convention Furniture Rental Inc. and transitioned to luxury outdoor furniture manufacturing. In 2021, leadership passed to Maria A. Contreras, who serves as president and continues the company’s focus on American‑made, handcrafted pieces.

The company designs, manufactures and customizes high‑end outdoor furniture. Its Las Vegas facility produces over 670 base products with millions of configuration options, and the team of seven experts handles custom design, space planning, manufacturing, and a rental division that serves one‑of‑a‑kind events across Southern Nevada. All pieces are built in‑house using domestic materials.

Clients span commercial and residential sectors. Commercial accounts include MAXEX/CVS, Cedarwood Development, Geenen Dekock Properties, W.M. Grace Companies, and architecture firms such as Klai Juba Wald Architecture + Interiors. Interior designers, landscape architects, and event planners also source custom and rental furniture for hotels, offices, private residences, and special events.

Somers Furniture emphasizes a service‑first approach, citing strict adherence to quality, perfection in design, and a personal touch that distinguishes it from larger corporations. The company highlights its American‑made pedigree, handcrafted production in Las Vegas, and the ability to deliver tailored solutions on schedule as core differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture design", "Furniture manufacturing", "Space planning", "Furniture rental for events", "Delivery and installation", "Product customization and modification"], "industries": ["Commercial real estate", "Residential", "Interior design", "Landscape architecture", "Event and hospitality"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["American\u2011made luxury outdoor furniture handcrafted in Las Vegas", "670+ base products with millions of customization options", "Full\u2011service design, manufacturing, space planning, and rental", "Dedicated delivery and installation crews", "Personal, service\u2011oriented client experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1989 by Debbi Somers -> /about-us", "Maria Contreras became president in 2021 -> /about-us", "Facility: 4,500 sq ft warehouse, showroom, manufacturing in Las Vegas -> /about-us", "Team of 7 experts -> /about-us", "670+ American\u2011made products with millions of customization options -> /about-us", "2,500+ custom pieces delivered -> /about-us", "Services: custom furniture, manufacturing, design, space planning, rental -> / and /about-us", "Commercial clients: MAXEX/CVS, Cedarwood Development, Geenen Dekock Properties, W.M. Grace Companies, Klai Juba Wald Architecture + Interiors -> / and /about-us", "Residential and interior designer/landscape designer clientele -> /", "Emphasis on service, quality, perfection in design -> / and /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Our manufacturing facility is loca