UPDATE companies SET description='South Central Polymers Inc., doing business as SCP Polymers, is a custom thermoplastic injection molding company based in Booneville, Mississippi. The business is led by a management team that includes CEO Bud Hanna, President Joshua S. Hanna, Ph.D., and Vice President Grant Hinton, who together bring more than 75 years of combined industry experience. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

